# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3): `ok` on the first line, then the warnings load decides (WARN-UNREAD), in L §8.5's order:
# sorted by code, then text, whatever the text's order (spare_b is declared first). Exit 0: the first line is `ok`.
=== options check exit=0
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31
  note "a model two inputs of which are read by nothing (invented)"

source card "a card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input spare_b: money PLN
input amt: money PLN
input spare_a: money PLN

def doubled: money PLN = amt + amt at reader

ask q: doubled law 2026-03-01

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
=== expect
ok
warning: WARN-UNREAD input spare_a is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input spare_b is read by nothing
